{"unit_id":"wangxilhy23__dsh-wx-desktop#card-zh","repo":"wangxilhy23/dsh-wx-desktop","commit":"c429a295847c290061f1370cc4bd829c6bd56b32","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wx-desktop 是面向 DSH Web GUI 的桌面端：它用 Electron 原生窗口载入本机启动的 DSH Web 界面，并复用用户的 profile。作为 DSH 插件安装后，Web 侧栏会出现“桌面端”按钮，点击即可启动应用；桌面程序也可独立启动。运行时会优先复用已有的 DSH 安装，或使用内置运行时，并在关窗时停止其子进程。适合希望在桌面窗口中使用现有 DSH 会话和插件的用户；默认使用本机 DSH profile，可用 DSH_HOME 更改目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/electron/main.mjs:408-441","src/electron/main.mjs:624-657","src/client/index.ts:100-167"]}
{"unit_id":"wangxilhy23__dsh-wx-desktop#card-en","repo":"wangxilhy23/dsh-wx-desktop","commit":"c429a295847c290061f1370cc4bd829c6bd56b32","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-wx-desktop opens the local DSH web GUI in an Electron window, reusing the user profile. Its DSH plugin adds a web sidebar button to launch the desktop app. It uses an active or bundled DSH runtime and stops the child process when closed. Set DSH_HOME to choose the profile directory.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/electron/main.mjs:408-441","src/electron/main.mjs:624-657","src/client/index.ts:100-167"]}
