{"unit_id":"wangxilhy23__dsh-wx-desktop#feature-1","repo":"wangxilhy23/dsh-wx-desktop","commit":"c429a295847c290061f1370cc4bd829c6bd56b32","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wx-desktop 的功能「桌面窗口运行 DSH」：在 Electron 窗口中启动本机 DSH Web GUI。应用启动时拉起 dsh web 并载入其本地地址，关闭窗口时结束对应子进程。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/electron/main.mjs:462-479","src/electron/main.mjs:554-591"]}
